message: >-
  If you use ReactionVariance, cite this software and separately cite the
  source study and Open Reaction Database dataset described in README.md.
title: ReactionVariance
abstract: >-
  A local scientific application for comparing reported yields and recorded
  experimental conditions across strictly matched published C–N coupling
  reactions from the Open Reaction Database.
